ext":"疲れているの……？　それなら私の膝枕でお休みなさい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あっ、膝よりも胸の方が……良かったかしら？」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"121","sourceWorkId":"18072","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"守護者業会No.3のシェアを誇る雲雀ヶ丘グループの一人娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕草がいちいち艶っぽい、同じ年とは思えない大人びた少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"才色兼備・文武両道・眉目秀麗、優しく慈愛に満ち、そして少しエッチな、ほぼ完璧と言っていい美人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれた時から鳳の跡取りと結婚するように教育を施され、完璧なお嫁さんになるため己を磨き続けてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのことに自負を持っており、故に自分が良い女だと自覚している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なので常に自信に満ちあふれ、躊躇うことなく信じた道を突き進む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし信じたことを貫き通すその姿勢は、時にやや盲目的ですらある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私の膝枕で悪いけれど、我慢してくれるかしら？　うふふ、可愛い寝顔」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21271"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"99 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"121","sourceWorkId":"18072","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"169 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"121","sourceWorkId":"18072","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"121","sourceWorkId":"18072","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"121","sourceWorkId":"18072","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25b1fc03d52764e7ba4dae2b3ae5095a3f59a5cad94c50f577c73e2fb2a91e91.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/742927e2aa97e227e7a6c6b3e24cef8c53654e8dfca1a64e3c8fb2a3c0473812.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小倉結衣","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:59714:21271:5936:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c12911","characterName":"安馬音 音々","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21272","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"59714"}],"egsCharacterIds":["122"],"vndbCharacterId":"c12911"},"originalCharacterName":"安馬音 音々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1201"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"鳳家から派遣された勇気の嫁候補。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常にポーッとしていて感情の起伏も少ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、以外に思慮深く、注意の観察もしっかりしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿は童顔であどけなさの残る顔立ち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全体的にポーっとしていて、どこか眠そうに見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのあどけない容姿とは裏腹にスタイルは良く隠れ巨乳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目によらず大食漢なため、ご飯やお菓子をくれる人(勇気)にすり寄ってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"歌が大好きで、その歌声に野良守護者すら寄ってくるらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「んー、おはよう……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ところで、今日のお昼ゴハンは何？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そう、ありがとう。おやすみなさい。またね」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"122","sourceWorkId":"18072","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"鳳家から派遣された勇気の嫁候補。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他の二人とは違いその意識は低いというか、ぜんぜん分かっていない感じがする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが勉強も運動も万能で、守護者を使う能力にも長けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常にポーッとしていて感情の起伏が少なく、激しい感情を剥き出しにすることがない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他者に対して興味が薄く、そのため他人に対して嫌悪感を覚えることもない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし、美味しいご飯をくれる人は好きであり、自然にすり寄っていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「んー、おはよう…… ところで、今日のお昼ゴハンは何？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21272"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"122","sourceWorkId":"18072","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"122","sourceWorkId":"18072","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"122","sourceWorkId":"18072","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"122","sourceWorkId":"18072","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/47dca6993af09c9c59b415be489898914e95137931d152262a22a3d60ff59bb0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7c3aacdaf48677fc152dcdef8a23eb67bda5c6fcabc2eb05b8ea2c9cec1feea.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤田しずく","creatorId":"vndb:s937","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s937","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s937","name":"藤田 しずく","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:59714:21272:16178:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c12912","characterName":"逢魔崎 沙夜子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21273","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"59714"}],"egsCharacterIds":["125"],"vndbCharacterId":"c12912"},"originalCharacterName":"逢魔崎 沙夜子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1030"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"height":{"revie